  "prefLabel": "We 1002.03 Public Access",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "We 1002.03 Public Access.\n\n(a) Persons may request information from the registry either by telephone or in writing.\n\n(b) The board shall respond to a request for information from the registry within 10 working days of the date of receipt.\n\n(c) Nothing herein shall preclude any person from requesting a review of the complete record of complaints in the board’s files in accordance with the right to know law, RSA 91-A.\n\nSource. #7307, eff 6-13-00; ss by #9179, eff 6-13-08; ss by #12083, eff 3-1-17",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/we100-1000.html"
